Description: ConsumerOS desktop, update, recovery, and compatibility tools
 Native graphical and command-line control plane for ConsumerOS. It provides
 system status, transactional offline updates, hardware and firmware discovery,
 recovery, application compatibility, migration, and optional feature profiles.
